Department of Marketing - Executive Officer / Assistant Officer
(Ref: EO/AO (MKT) 2026-08-21)
Responsibilities
provide support for academic staff to perform teaching and administrative duties;
assist in the planning and implementation of initiatives on mentorship, internship and overseas exchange, etc.;
create and curate content on websites and social media platforms;
organise activities to engage students, alumni, and external stakeholders; and
liaise with external stakeholders, such as educational institutions, business enterprises, trade associations, nonprofit organisations, and government agencies, to advance the Department’s strategic goals.
Applicants Should
possess a bachelor’s degree with at least 3 years of relevant work experience, preferably in the tertiary education sector;
have a good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (Cantonese and Putonghua);
have proficiency in the use of office software applications and good knowledge of social media platforms;
have good organisational and communication skills and the ability to work independently; and
be a team player, accountable and proactive.
Applicants with less experience will be considered as an Assistant Officer.
